## ⚙️ Plan and Configure Azure Monitor Agent (AMA) & Data Collection Rules (DCR)

Deployed Azure Monitor Agent (AMA) and created Data Collection Rules (DCRs) to define how logs are collected from Azure and hybrid resources. Learned how AMA replaces the legacy Log Analytics Agent for modern data collection.

**Key Learning**
- Installed Azure Monitor Agent
- Created Data Collection Rules
- Assigned DCRs to Azure resources
- Optimized telemetry collection

